[ti:Camooweal]
[00:17.02] Should ever I go back to Camooweal
[00:23.60] 'Twould be in the spring when desert flowers bloom
[00:30.09] Oh, the spinifex I know would still be there
[00:36.67] And the desert pea would brighten up the gloom
